      sections: [{"id":"s1","title":"Sales Dashboard","whyItMatters":"Build a professional sales dashboard.","content":"**Project Overview:**\n\nBuild a complete sales dashboard in Excel:\n\n- Monthly revenue trends\n- Regional sales breakdown\n- Top-performing products\n- Sales team rankings\n- YTD vs budget comparison\n\n```text\nSales Dashboard Layout:\n=====================\n\nKPI Cards:\n  Total Revenue: $5.2M  +15% YoY\n  Avg Deal Size: $12.4K\n  Win Rate: 34%\n  Pipeline: $8.1M\n\nCharts:\n  Revenue Trend (Line Chart)\n  Sales by Region (Map or Bar)\n  Top Products (Horizontal Bar)\n\nFilters:\n  Year: 2024\n  Region: All\n  Product: All\n```\n\nApply your Excel skills to create a real business tool.","codeExamples":[{"id":"s1","title":"Dashboard Project","description":"Build the sales dashboard","code":{"excel":"Excel Dashboard\n==============\n\nKPI Cards:\n  Revenue: =SUM(Sales[Amount])\n  Win Rate: =COUNTIF(Sales[Status],\"Won\")/COUNTA(Sales[Status])\n  Pipeline: =SUMIF(Sales[Stage],\"Proposal\",Sales[Value])"},"explanation":"Create an interactive sales dashboard."}]}],
