      sections: [{"id":"s1","title":"Financial Tracker","whyItMatters":"Build a complete financial tracking system.","content":"**Project Overview:**\n\nBuild a financial tracker:\n\n- Income and expense tracking\n- Budget vs actual analysis\n- Monthly financial reports\n- Spending categories\n- Savings goal tracking\n\n```text\nFinancial Tracker:\n=================\n\nMonthly Summary:\n  Income:  $8,000\n  Expenses: $5,200\n  Savings: $2,800 (35%)\n\nCategories:\n  Housing:  $1,800\n  Food:     $600\n  Transport: $400\n  Utilities: $350\n  Entertainment: $250\n\nBudget vs Actual:\n  Budget:  $6,000\n  Actual:  $5,200\n  Variance: $800 (13% under)\n```\n\nMaster financial tracking with Excel.","codeExamples":[{"id":"s1","title":"Finance Project","description":"Build the financial tracker","code":{"excel":"Financial Tracker\n=================\n\n=SUM(Income) - SUM(Expenses)\n=Budget - Actual\n=Variance / Budget"},"explanation":"Create a financial tracking spreadsheet."}]}],
