      sections: [{"id":"s1","title":"Inventory System","whyItMatters":"Build a complete inventory management system.","content":"**Project Overview:**\n\nBuild an inventory management system:\n\n- Product catalog with categories\n- Stock level tracking\n- Reorder point alerts\n- Supplier information\n- Inventory valuation\n- Movement history\n\n```text\nInventory System:\n================\n\nProduct: SKU-001 'Widget A'\n  Current Stock: 150\n  Reorder Level: 50\n  Status: In Stock\n\nAlerts:\n  SKU-045 'Bolt M8': 12 units - REORDER!\n  SKU-102 'Washer': 8 units - REORDER!\n\nInventory Value: $45,200\nStock Turns: 4.5/year\n\nDashboard:\n  Low Stock Items: 3\n  Out of Stock: 0\n  Total SKUs: 245\n```\n\nBuild a professional inventory system.","codeExamples":[{"id":"s1","title":"Inventory Project","description":"Build the inventory system","code":{"excel":"Inventory Tracker\n=================\n\n=IF(Stock<=Reorder,\"REORDER!\",\"OK\")\n=Stock * UnitPrice\n=StockTurn / Period"},"explanation":"Create an inventory management spreadsheet."}]}],
