      sections: [{"id":"s1","title":"Automated Reports","whyItMatters":"Build an automated reporting system.","content":"**Project Overview:**\n\nBuild an automated reporting system:\n\n- Template-based reports\n- VBA-driven automation\n- Data refresh pipelines\n- PDF export automation\n- Email distribution\n- Scheduled generation\n\n```text\nAutomated Report System:\n======================\n\nVBA Macro: GenerateMonthlyReport\n  1. Refresh data connections\n  2. Update calculations\n  3. Refresh PivotTables\n  4. Update charts\n  5. Export as PDF\n  6. Send via Outlook\n\nReport Types:\n  - Monthly Sales Report\n  - Weekly KPI Summary\n  - Daily Inventory Status\n  - Quarterly Financial Review\n```\n\nBuild real automation with VBA.","codeExamples":[{"id":"s1","title":"Automation Project","description":"Build the reporting system","code":{"excel":"' VBA Report Generator\nSub GenerateReport()\n    Sheets(\"Data\").Calculate\n    Sheets(\"Dashboard\").ExportAsFixedFormat _\n        Type:=xlTypePDF\n    MsgBox \"Report generated!\"\nEnd Sub"},"explanation":"Create an automated reporting system."}]}],
